                "text": "Innovations in healthcare technology, such as virtual health, are delivering better health outcomes for patients and expanding access to underserved, rural communities like those in #CA23. I enjoyed meeting with Southern California Permanente Medical Group this week to discuss how we can continue to expand virtual health services in our rural communities.",
