                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare open enrollment ends December 7th, meaning that time is running out for you to change your Medicare health and coverage plans. If you\u2019re satisfied with your current Medicare plan and it is still offered, you don\u2019t need to change your plan. If not, you must make your choice by December 7th. If you need more information on the process, please reach out to my District office at (760) 247-1815.",
