                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The SUPPORT for Patients and Communities Act has passed the Energy and Commerce Committee! I\u2019m especially proud it includes my bill, the 9-8-8 Lifeline Cybersecurity Responsibility Act. Strengthening the cybersecurity of the 9-8-8 Suicide and Crisis Lifeline is essential to ensuring Americans have uninterrupted access to lifesaving mental health support.",
