                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At this week\u2019s Energy and Commerce Health Subcommittee hearing, I discussed the promise of new cancer screening technologies and the importance of ensuring that both patients and physicians have access to the best tools available. I also underscored how artificial intelligence can help make our healthcare system efficient and patient-centered",
