                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At this week\u2019s Energy and Commerce Full Committee markup, I spoke in support of bipartisan legislation to reauthorize telehealth grant programs that expand access to care in rural and underserved communities. These programs are a common-sense way to help patients, families, and providers connect more easily and improve health outcomes nationwide.",
