                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The SUPPORT for Patients and Communities Act has officially been signed into law, and I\u2019m proud that it includes my bill, the 9-8-8 Lifeline Cybersecurity Responsibility Act. Strengthening the cybersecurity of the 9-8-8 Suicide and Crisis Lifeline is essential to ensuring Americans have reliable, uninterrupted access to lifesaving mental health support. This new law also delivers important resources to help families struggling with substance abuse, ensuring our communities have the tools they need for prevention, treatment, and recovery.",
